   "title": "Exterior design",
   "intro": "The striking feature of the Flyer 8 SPACEdeck is its savvy combination of elegance and functionality.\nWith its flush-fitting deck plan that makes it easy to get around the boat, the Flyer 8 SPACEdeck offers passengers complete freedom to enjoy their favourite water sports. The lowered pulpits, which further streamline the boat’s silhouette, provide wonderful clear views over the sea and the horizon.",
