   "title": "HIGHLIGHTS",
   "intro": "",
   "items": [
    {
     "title": "OPTIMISED PASSAGEWAY",
     "text": "The fully flush-fitting deck plan lets you move around freely from the aft swim platforms up to the front of the boat. An undeniable advantage when sport fishing!"
    },
    {
     "title": "SPACIOUS FORWARD SUNDECK",
     "text": "At the front of the Flyer 8 SPACEdeck, the side and central benchseats convert into spacious sundecks. The forward platform is fully accessible."
    },
    {
     "title": "MODULAR COCKPIT",
     "text": "The bolster seats pivot 180° and can be used to create a convivial space around the cockpit table. Up to 6 people can sit around the table, just like at the front of the boat."
    },
    {
     "title": "VERSATILE",
     "text": "The cockpit can be configured either as a fishing station, or as a comfortable benchseat that converts to a sunbathing area. A water-ski pole can also be fitted. The two swim platforms provide easy onboard access, and facilitate diving when at anchor."
    }
   ],
